Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}$7 BILLION
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Two teenagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:02.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A failed grocery app.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:04.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Now it is worth seven billion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Here is how the money came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:07.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Then the money came in waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:13.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In 2024, six hundred and sixty-five million dollars at a three point six billion valuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:17.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A few months later, three hundred and fifty million more at five billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:24.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In October 2025, a US pension fund called Calpers led a four hundred and fifty million dollar round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Zepto was now worth seven billion dollars.
